' Autonomous Enterprise concept visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-011 §20 + ADR-ES-011 §1 + §3.1 + §11.
' Illustrates the Autonomous Enterprise as a specialisation of Enterprise,
' with enterprise-level autonomy ;;; bounded authority ;;; policy and
' governance ;;; and explicit intervention and escalation.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml autonomous-enterprise

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Autonomous Enterprise, Enterprise Specialisation

rectangle "Enterprise\n(ES:CONCEPT:enterprise)" as enterprise #E0E8F0
rectangle "Autonomous Enterprise\n(ES:CONCEPT:autonomous-enterprise)" as ae #FFE4B5

rectangle "Autonomous Value Stream" as avs #E6E6FA
rectangle "Autonomous Operations" as aops #E0FFFF
rectangle "Agentic Operations" as agops #F0FFF0
rectangle "Agentic Workflow" as awf #FFFACD
rectangle "Authority" as authority #FFE4E1
rectangle "Policy" as policy #F5DEB3

enterprise --> ae : specialises

ae --> avs : autonomous-enterprise-realizes-through
ae --> aops : autonomous-enterprise-operates-through
ae --> agops : uses (mixed mode)
ae --> awf : uses (execution mechanism)
ae --> authority : operates-within
ae --> policy : governed-by

note right of ae
  Per ADR-ES-011 §1 + §3.1 + AE-AUTO-CON-001:
  Autonomous Enterprise specialises Enterprise,
  not Agentic Enterprise, not Autonomous
  Operations, not Autonomous Value Stream.
  Per AE-AUTO-CON-013: Autonomous Enterprise is
  orthogonal to Agentic Enterprise (parallel
  Enterprise specialisation).
end note

@enduml
